TEXT 0 -288 Left 3 ;#147 MV209 two-J310 voltage-controlled oscillator
TEXT 0 -240 Left 2 ;Source: Alan Wolke (W2AEW), https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=icw8terKP-M
TEXT 0 -192 Left 2 ;Two reverse-biased MV209 varactors tune a 1uH Colpitts tank; J1 oscillates and J2 buffers the output.
TEXT 0 560 Left 2 !.lib ..\..\LTspice\Models\Unverified\MV209_legacy.lib
TEXT 0 592 Left 2 !.lib ..\..\LTspice\Models\InterFET\J310.lib
TEXT 0 624 Left 2 !.step param VB list 1.286 12.39 24.79
TEXT 0 656 Left 2 !.tran 0 200u 0 2n uic
TEXT 0 688 Left 2 !.ic V(TANK)=10m
TEXT 0 720 Left 2 !.meas tran T1 WHEN V(TANK)=0 RISE=1 TD=150u
TEXT 0 752 Left 2 !.meas tran T2 WHEN V(TANK)=0 RISE=51 TD=150u
TEXT 0 784 Left 2 !.meas tran FREQ PARAM 50/(T2-T1)
TEXT 0 832 Left 2 ;Rscope=100k, InterFET J310-M, and legacy MV209 model are explicit simulation choices; Alan did not specify the scope load or device bins.
